    {
      "text": "A screenshot of a graph-editor canvas centred on a highlighted green node, HarvestAction 'Mine Graphite'. Dashed 'from' edges join it to four Relationship nodes: 'hasInput' (above), 'conformsTo' (left), 'performedBy' (upper right) and 'hasOutput' (lower left). Solid edges run from it to Organization 'Graphite Mineing LLD' (labelled 'originatedBy') and to PhysicalLocation 'Mine Site A' (labelled 'action_location'). Other nodes are drawn faded in the background and are not legible. The spellings 'Mineing LLD' and 'action_location' are as drawn.",
